nly one who can break the curse for them, <strong>things get really interesting!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The curse scroll says the oni must <strong>'get love'</strong> from a member of the Hayashi family to break the curse. That means sex, and Asano's the last of the Hayashi clan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asano's been through a lot...<strong>maybe a sexy diversion is just what he needs?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354770/extras/0ea0d81e721b2d8d735d8c3ddf0d8251.avif?t=1764737580\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354770/extras/a348fd2d832fc7505764aba3ac3d0462.avif?t=1764737580\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL VOICE ACTING!!!</strong> With Advanced Settings Where You Can Adjust Volumes for Each Character and Mute Any You Don't Like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Oni Love Interests!\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Hours of Game Play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Original Traditional Japanese Themed Sound Track!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 Beautifully Painted Images, With Numerous Variations! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fun, Dramatic, Touching, Quirky, and <strong>Anime-ish Story</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Love Stories per Route! Side Characters Mina and Sakuna Date the Oni Too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A Bonus Ninja Love Story for Aku in the Nensu Route! (Sponsored by a Supporter for Everyone to Enjoy!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Sakuna/Oni Sex S